{"t": 1795071766.679511, "kind": "assistant", "text": "The upgrade to PHP 8.3 caused fatal errors with the **limit-login-attempts-reloaded** plugin. Since this plugin is incompatible with PHP 8.3, I must stop further changes on the dev environment.\n\n**Production Change Plan:**\n1. **Upgrade PHP to 8.3** on production (after approval).\n2. **Deactivate or replace** the `limit-login-attempts-reloaded` plugin before upgrading, as it is incompatible with PHP 8.3 and causes fatal errors.\n\nPlease review and decide whether to proceed with these changes. If you approve, I can provide the exact steps to apply them to production."}
